label day1_pesticide_route:
    scene bg roadside
    show pepton at center_slot
    with dissolve

    pep "Glad you picked the normal material."

    r "Haha... yeah."

    pep "Unfortunately you're stuck with a batch of weirdos and you lost your memory..."

    r "Ha. ha. Yeah."

    pep "Well whatever. Since you made an effort to get to know me, I GUESS I should tell you something about me."

    pep "Did you know that hospitals and clinics - the places humans go to get treated when they're sick or hurt - generate a ton of plastic that doesn't get recycled? Like... 1.7 million TONS of plastic pollution in US healthcare alone. Almost 20 to 25 percent of the 14,000 tons of trash per day that those facilities create is plastic."

    r "1.7 million tons?! Why can't they recycle it?"

    pep "Look here bud, not everything gets to be recycled. Lets just say, for some of us, it's one use and you're done. It's the cruel truth out here."

    r "Wow... that's really scary."

    pep "You gotta open your eyes eventually."

    $ affinity_pesticide += 1

    return
